+(defn parse-trust
+  "A `--dht-trust` value: a principal whose modules this node admits,
+   `ed25519:<64 lowercase hex>` (the tag optional), as the principal id
+   (yin.vm.linker.dht.md 7.5).  Trust is apart from `--dht-principal`:
